// ============================================================
// Flyer Studio — selectable font library for real text compositing.
// 117 real Google Fonts, each stored as its own woff2 buffer
// (base64) — @napi-rs/canvas registers woff2 directly, confirmed live,
// so no TTF conversion step is needed. Each font was fetched at its
// heaviest available static weight (900 where it exists, falling back
// down to whatever that family actually ships) so every option already
// reads as a confident headline weight with no extra bolding needed.
// require()'d (not read from disk) for the same esbuild-bundling reason
// documented in _flyer-fonts-data.js / _canvas.js's header.
// ============================================================

